<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Girlfriend's Day ❤️</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Georgia, serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#120014,#2a001d,#50002f);
color:white;
overflow-x:hidden;
text-align:center;
}

.hero{
padding:60px 20px;
}

h1{
font-size:45px;
color:#ffb6c1;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

h2{
font-weight:normal;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

img{
width:90%;
max-width:420px;
border-radius:20px;
margin:20px auto;
display:block;
box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(255,255,255,.25);
}

.card{
width:90%;
max-width:700px;
margin:30px auto;
padding:30px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
border-radius:20px;
backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
line-height:1.9;
}

button{
padding:15px 35px;
border:none;
border-radius:50px;
background:#ff2e63;
color:white;
font-size:18px;
cursor:pointer;
margin-top:25px;
transition:.4s;
}

button:hover{
transform:scale(1.05);
}

#letter{
display:none;
animation:fade 2s;
}

@keyframes fade{
from{opacity:0;}
to{opacity:1;}
}

.heart{
position:fixed;
color:#ff4d88;
animation:float 8s linear infinite;
font-size:22px;
}

@keyframes float{
0%{
transform:translateY(100vh);
opacity:1;
}
100%{
transform:translateY(-120vh);
opacity:0;
}
}

footer{
margin:50px;
color:#ddd;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="hero">

<h1>Happy Girlfriend's Day ❤️</h1>

<h2>For My Beautiful Sherry</h2>

</div>

<img src="photo1.jpg">

<img src="photo2.jpg">

<div class="card">

<p>

Every beautiful story starts with one page...

Ours has only just begun.

I'm grateful that life allowed our paths to cross.

I don't want to rush our story.

I simply want us to enjoy every laugh, every conversation, every memory, and every moment together.

Happy Girlfriend's Day, Sherry.

❤️

</p>

<button onclick="showLetter()">

Open My Heart ❤️

</button>

</div>

<div class="card" id="letter">

<h2>A Little Message...</h2>

<p>

Sherry,

Thank you for walking into my life.

We've only just started this journey, but every conversation already makes me smile.

I don't promise perfection.

I promise honesty, respect, laughter, and someone who'll always appreciate you.

I hope this is just the beginning of something beautiful.

<br><br>

<b>Mi hermosa...</b>

<br><br>

Gracias por llegar a mi vida.

<br>

Quiero conocerte más cada día.

<br>

Eres una persona muy especial para mí.

<br>

Que este sea el comienzo de una historia hermosa.

<br><br>

(Thank you for coming into my life.

I want to know you more every day.

You are very special to me.

May this be the beginning of a beautiful story.)

<br><br>

Happy Girlfriend's Day ❤️

<br><br>

Love,

<b>Steve</b>

</p>

</div>

<footer>

✨ Our journey starts here... ✨

</footer>

<script>

function showLetter(){

document.getElementById("letter").style.display="block";

window.scrollTo({

top:document.body.scrollHeight,

behavior:"smooth"

});

}

function hearts(){

const heart=document.createElement("div");

heart.className="heart";

heart.innerHTML="❤️";

heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";

heart.style.fontSize=(20+Math.random()*30)+"px";

document.body.appendChild(heart);

setTimeout(()=>heart.remove(),8000);

}

setInterval(hearts,400);

</script>

</body>

</html>
